<title>SINGAPORE: Stamford Tyres sees S$28 mln fire loss.</title>
<headline>Stamford Tyres sees S$28 mln fire loss.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stamford Tyres Corp Ltd said on Tuesday it estimated its loss from a fire at one of its Singapore warehouse at Singapore $28 million.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement these losses would be fully recovered from insurance claims.</p>
<p>The fire, on June 20, affected only one of its three warehouses, the company said.</p>
<p>&quot;Our business resumed as usual today. Immediate shipments of fast moving stocks from our major suppliers have been arranged,&quot; it said.</p>
<p>The company's shares have been suspended since the fire.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703199)</p>
</text>
